le se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d083f1cc-2eb6-4361-a62f-56b3e83d2d9a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-62a26373-dd70-4243-905d-6307b9a5fd34\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1a10d105-05b5-4712-971c-30bd68e6ab72\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9aec5d1c-574f-48e7-94f2-c3f27f8b23ea\">입니다.​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9eba68c6-704e-482e-ba35-26e62a1a402b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-55e8909e-4d6c-497f-8e0a-5db7a21eff13\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b23324c-c1da-4926-be01-b39f223d0107\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0968cd6f-84e3-4281-a24f-d3020314e52e\">2/11(화) 16:30 ~ 17:30 경에 무점검 업데이트 및</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-44df8a7e-acd1-4720-a72d-9d24871563c3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d681d360-cd3b-4c86-bb52-2e1571af34f8\">업데이트 리소스 다운로드가 진행되었습니다.​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-66fe29d7-e10c-40a7-8c19-0da4865e4c4a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7f2bfc9e-16a0-47f2-b6d4-7d6f9ae0b0aa\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a4ac25ab-55d0-4e7e-afcc-284d5a0c8182\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a37c9b0d-8716-4616-8d7b-05a328c5869b\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e6b9dcab-c2c8-4f9a-acf9-f375390b9c7c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-78b488ab-b065-4ea8-a497-d7b695be453a\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f6ae94cb-b7fa-440e-b587-1e4f55c70d70\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b763650e-fcd8-438a-ab02-73f8cf5ae89c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-171b4d98-5d02-4bc4-9ed0-34c09a694e37\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5b56ad22-333d-46eb-9126-1f2c01b77f06\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0a3f3835-b5d0-4cb0-b5bb-ad2f75a829f4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-86b5783e-2630-4437-8c15-756db6f0ad4d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-577f2595-ef81-4090-868a-a84787febc10\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4f3154ee-d4d9-493b-8ea6-3b4ca512aa9c\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7becb195-d917-4e67-a0c3-bc9a68830cb9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-74ef832f-ba62-4f78-b66a-6ae4fe47d5d5\"><b>📢 2월 11일(화) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d6e1bd84-925a-4b5c-b48c-d029e5618a1c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ffe4f457-d1ed-47c8-8ca8-a08db6939575\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a08b252c-90ee-4a57-bf8d-0441d51ef76b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7cf2274b-05b6-4c6f-9719-3d07431f76a0\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6c9c1748-f424-4f2a-8a5c-3314df248b02\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-65857a87-6eb9-43a9-81d1-1c1771380f71\">- 2/11(화) 16:30 ~ 17:30 경​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bbf68514-b9fa-4953-be34-30c6d3235f53\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a5e96781-fa5d-4079-932b-33ab6f6d5ff1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c96c49c0-57da-4afd-b6b7-80d40a2e231d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0f36d2fb-7c37-44c3-9885-89bd87b048ba\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9847c284-b26f-4d66-9d8e-7d7b2c51a3ba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6bfb5ab3-23a3-4197-b7af-b7d6b27b1466\">1. 앵커 : 이노센트 메이드 스킬1 「불가사리(모양) 오므라이스」의 2회차 효과가 일부 스킬의 분배 대미지 효과에 반영되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a51f0040-83e8-4d9c-b0c1-efe40d2ea59f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e63f06d9-6e3c-4034-a6b3-880206e31f22\">[대상]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a66dbdcc-8c53-4c0f-9bdd-07f6aa19559b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cbe73713-a01b-4c5c-b28b-0be59ba55096\">└ 도로시 버스트 스킬 「실낙원」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d06cc15-191b-458b-b924-5599f7ecaaf9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e7ca4600-558c-4dd2-b6ed-5625e46fefd1\">└ 트로니 스킬1 「T.Rony 봄버」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-452d42f0-ff31-4dc9-87f0-58f7efcd40d1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aa498771-2b1b-4742-a7cd-59c35f0ec525\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-83d6de12-69ea-44a5-9453-9b1692f9558f\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-edc221ba-1b2d-4615-bff5-c2328b67b332\">​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ad66fd5a-7e3c-4eae-bad1-4b5acbc60838\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ab511880-2d5c-4cd4-9d4d-bc4a6377db08\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ffd66a57-b2b2-4ba7-a278-b8bb9831282a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-029b521e-93ba-44f6-b6a5-d7b69e23f67c\">·····················································································​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a038a33f-b735-4842-b22f-64cc2ecb6d38\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-749f854c-c1a9-42e0-8c5c-d72d029048ec\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b51cffb2-2d23-4c6b-9b8d-9600031e48ab\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-411a1bf9-0963-4bf8-98cd-c3b651a84445\">​게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a122a29e-4a6a-4755-9bc2-5fe4f137dfc4\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-a122a29e-4a6a-4755-9bc2-5fe4f137dfc4\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAyMTFfMjE0/MDAxNzM5MjYzNTk0MDc1.nxj9EiBrNNDdljYWgCeLc6YD78goXMn_EyO_qNk0aVMg.K-TFvDAh3Od310in4pjVX1vX4HFxJgMKrckcHUTowuMg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"100\", \"originalHeight\" : \"100\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAyMTFfMjE0/MDAxNzM5MjYzNTk0MDc1.nxj9EiBrNNDdljYWgCeLc6YD78goXMn_EyO_qNk0aVMg.K-TFvDAh3Od310in4pjVX1vX4HFxJgMKrckcHUTowuMg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a4df022c-9d1e-454d-82ea-1c3dc5b76f4c\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                  